00 + 240 + 30 = 1170\n\\]\n\nWe can also verify this using the standard multiplication algorithm:\n\n\\[\n\\begin{array}{r}\n   26 \\\\\n\\times 45 \\\\\n\\hline\n   130 \\quad (\\text{26 multiplied by 5}) \\\\\n+1040 \\quad (\\text{26 multiplied by 40}) \\\\\n\\hline\n  1170 \\\\\n\\end{array}\n\\]\n\nBoth methods confirm that the product of 26 and 45 is \\(\\boxed{1170}\\).",
