ultiplication algorithm:\n\n1. Multiply 83 by 9: \\(83 \\times 9 = 747\\)\n2. Multiply 83 by 50: \\(83 \\times 50 = 4150\\)\n3. Add the results: \\(747 + 4150 = 4897\\)\n\nBoth methods confirm that the product of 83 and 59 is \\(\\boxed{4897}\\). The user's answer of 4807 is incorrect, likely due to an arithmetic error in their calculation.",
