   \\]\n\n### Final Answer\nThe product of 58 and 81 is \\(\\boxed{4698}\\).  \n\n**Note**: The initial guess of \\(8,\\!698\\) is incorrect. A common mistake might involve miscalculating \\(58 \\times 8\\) as \\(864\\) instead of \\(464\\), leading to an incorrect result. The correct steps confirm the answer is **4,698**.",
