 \\[\n  100 \\times 75 = 100 \\times (70 + 5) = (100 \\times 70) + (100 \\times 5) = 7000 + 500 = 7500.\n  \\]\n\n**Answer:** The correct product is **7500**. The initial guess of 7400 is incorrect, likely due to an arithmetic error (e.g., miscalculating \\(100 \\times 5\\) as 400 instead of 500).",
