lculation.\n</think>\n\nThe product of 78 and 35 is calculated as follows:\n\n**Step-by-Step Calculation:**\n1. **Breakdown using the standard multiplication algorithm:**\n   ```\n     78\n   \u00d7 35\n   -------\n     390   (78 \u00d7 5)\n   +2340   (78 \u00d7 30, shifted one position left)\n   -------\n     2730\n   ```\n   \n2. **Verification via distributive property:**\n   \\[\n   78 \\times 35 = (70 + 8)(30 + 5) = 70 \\times 30 + 70 \\times 5 + 8 \\times 30 + 8 \\times 5\n   \\]\n   \\[\n   = 2100 + 350 + 240 + 40 = 2730\n   \\]\n\n3. **Alternative method using (80 - 2) \u00d7 35:**\n   \\[\n   (80 - 2) \\times 35 = 80 \\times 35 - 2 \\times 35 = 2800 - 70 = 2730\n   \\]\n\n**Conclusion:**  \nThe correct product of 78 and 35 is **2730**. The answer 2430 is incorrect, likely due to an arithmetic mistake during addition or multiplication. Always double-check your steps to avoid errors!\n\n<\uff5cFinal Answer\uff5c>2730",
