0 \\)  \n   - \\( 38 \\times 2 = 76 \\)\n\n3. **Add the results:**  \n   \\( 380 + 76 = 456 \\)\n\n**Final Answer:**  \n\\( \\boxed{456} \\)\n\n**Note:** The initial guess of 457 is incorrect. A common mistake might occur when adding \\( 380 + 76 \\), where \\( 380 + 70 = 450 \\), and then mistakenly adding \\( 7 \\) instead of \\( 6 \\). The correct sum is \\( 450 + 6 = 456 \\).",
