y 86 by 6 (ones place):  \n  \\( 86 \\times 6 = 516 \\)\n- Multiply 86 by 70 (tens place, represented as 7 \u00d7 10):  \n  \\( 86 \\times 7 = 602 \\), then shift left by one digit: \\( 6020 \\)\n\n**Step 2: Add the partial products**  \n\\( 516 + 6020 = 6536 \\)\n\n**Verification with the distributive property (FOIL):**  \n\\( (80 + 6)(70 + 6) = 80 \\times 70 + 80 \\times 6 + 6 \\times 70 + 6 \\times 6 \\)  \n\\( = 5600 + 480 + 420 + 36 = 6536 \\)\n\n**Alternative method (difference of squares):**  \nRecognize \\( 86 = 81 + 5 \\) and \\( 76 = 81 - 5 \\):  \n\\( (81 + 5)(81 - 5) = 81^2 - 5^2 = 6561 - 25 = 6536 \\)\n\n**Conclusion:**  \nThe correct product is **6536**, not 6336. The user likely made an arithmetic error in their calculation.\n\n**Final Answer:**  \n\\boxed{6536}",
