\n\n**Final Answer:**  \n\\(\\boxed{2214}\\)  \n\nThe initial guess of 4214 is incorrect. The correct result is **2214**. A likely source of error could be misadding the partial products (e.g., \\(2160 + 54\\) being miscalculated as \\(2160 + 2054\\)), but standard multiplication confirms the correct answer is 2214.",
