mes 80 = 4,\\!400 \\quad \\text{and} \\quad 55 \\times 8 = 440\n\\]  \n\n**Step 3:** Add the results:  \n\\[\n4,\\!400 + 440 = 4,\\!840\n\\]  \n\n### Final Answer:  \n\\boxed{4840}  \n\n### Note:  \nThe user\u2019s proposed answer of **4,\\!849** is incorrect. The error likely arose from a miscalculation during addition (e.g., adding \\(4,\\!400 + 440\\) as \\(4,\\!849\\) instead of \\(4,\\!840\\)). The correct result is **4,\\!840**.",
