sults:**\n   \\[\n   1,\\!920 + 48 = 1,\\!968\n   \\]\n\n**Final Answer:**  \nThe product of 48 and 41 is **1,968**.\n\n**Note:** The initial guess of 1,962 is incorrect. A common mistake could involve miscalculating \\( 48 \\times 40 \\) or misadding the components. Always double-check each step to avoid errors!",
