r:**  \n\\boxed{2688}\n\n---\n\n**Note:** The initial guess of 2682 is incorrect. A common mistake here is miscalculating \\(42 \\times 4\\). For instance, if \\(2 \\times 4 = 2\\) (instead of 8), the sum becomes \\(2520 + 162 = 2682\\). Always double-check each step to avoid such errors!",
