e 3008 comes from, but the correct answer is definitely 1008. Probably a simple arithmetic error on their part.\n</think>\n\nThe product of 24 and 42 is calculated as follows:\n\n\\[\n24 \\times 42 = 24 \\times (40 + 2) = (24 \\times 40) + (24 \\times 2) = 960 + 48 = 1008\n\\]\n\n**Answer:** \\boxed{1008}",
