50.\n\nNow, add the two partial products together: 744 + 4650. Let me add those. Starting from the right, 4 + 0 is 4. 4 + 5 is 9. 7 + 6 is 13, so write down 3 and carry over 1. Then 0 (since there's no thousands place in 744) plus 4 plus the carried 1 is 5. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
